{"id":"659991","name":"荷叶鸡","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659991/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土鸡","amount":"一只"}],"sub":[{"name":"荷叶","amount":"两张"},{"name":"姜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"红葱头","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土鸡清洗干净。","img":"images/659991/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"碗里放入盐、胡椒粉、酱油、蚝油、盐焗鸡粉。","img":"images/659991/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜、葱适量。","img":"images/659991/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把所有调料抹满鸡的全身，里里外外都要涂抹均匀。","img":"images/659991/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入姜丝葱末。","img":"images/659991/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"腌制入味一个小时。","img":"images/659991/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中烧开水，荷叶放入锅内煮十分钟。","img":"images/659991/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮软的荷叶清洗干净，把腌制入味的鸡放入荷叶中间。","img":"images/659991/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把姜葱塞进鸡肚子里。","img":"images/659991/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"荷叶把鸡包裹起来，用绳子绑紧。","img":"images/659991/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"电饭锅底刷油。","img":"images/659991/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入姜片和葱垫底。","img":"images/659991/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把整鸡放入锅内。","img":"images/659991/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"用无水焗鸡的时间。","img":"images/659991/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"中途翻个面，盖上盖继续焖焗，时间不够，可以加时。","img":"images/659991/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"时间结束，焗好了。","img":"images/659991/step_16.jpeg"},{"step":17,"desc":"剥开鸡腿，肉质嫩滑。","img":"images/659991/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。撕成小块，最后把汤汁浇入表面即可。","img":"images/659991/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}